    "scenesThatPass": [
      "THORENSEN: God damn it.\nTHORENSEN: Now I know why we all got amnesia. Why would you want to remember this shit-hole?\nLENA: I’d like to remember it.\nRADEK: Sure. It’s beautiful.",
      "THORENSEN: Think this place might show up on the maps?\nSHEPPARD: Doubt it.\nSHEPPARD: I think it’s just a fishing hut.\nLENA: ... These are extremely strange flowers.",
      "LENA: To look at them you wouldn’t say they’re the same species.\nLENA: But they’re all growing from the same branch structure. So not just the same species. The same plant.\nRADEK: They’re like snowflakes. Each one is different. I’ve never seen anything like it.\nLENA: It seems stuck in a continuous mutation. Some kind of morphogenesis error.",
      "LENA: So what do you see in there?\nRADEK: Hey, check this out.\nRADEK: We could use these. Be much quicker way of getting across the swamp.\nRADEK: Shall we see if they still float?",
      "LENA: RADEK!\nTHORENSEN: What the Hell happened?\nLENA: A gator took her! We’ve got to -\nRADEK: Help! HELP ME!"
    ]
  },
